#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guided_tours.website_event_index
msgid ""
"Walk alongside fellow travelers as our passionate guides bring each city to "
"life, from medieval alleyways and majestic cathedrals to modern "
"neighborhoods full of local flavor. Our groups are <strong>small enough to "
"stay personal</strong>, but <strong>big enough to share laughs and moments</"
"strong> you'll remember long after the tour ends."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guided_tours.template_footer_descriptive
msgid ""
"We are a team of travel enthusiasts dedicated to enriching lives through "
"unforgettable journeys. We curate exceptional tours to create lasting "
"memories for our travelers. Our experiences cater to adventurers and leisure "
"seekers alike."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guided_tours.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We believe that traveling is more than just visiting new places, it's about "
"experiencing them through the eyes of those who call them home. Our guided "
"tours are thoughtfully designed to bring you closer to local cultures, off-"
"the-beaten-path locations, and authentic moments that turn ordinary trips "
"into lifelong memories.\n"
"                                            <br/><br/><br/>"
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_1
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_2
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_4
msgid ""
"We offer a 30-day return policy for all products. Items must be in their "
"original condition, unused, and include the receipt or proof of purchase. "
"Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days of receiving the returned "
"item."
msgstr ""
"当社は、全てのプロダクトに対して30日間の返品ポリシーを適用しています。返品に"
"は、未使用でご購入時の状態であること、および購入時のレシートまたは証明書の添"
"付が必要です。返金は、返品商品を受領してから5-7営業日以内に致します。"

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guided_tours.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We skip the tourist traps to deliver genuine experiences, local stories, and "
"meaningful culture."
